{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 16,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        53.92401885986328,
        267.83563232421875,
        70.70701599121094
      ],
      "text": "Important additional considerations",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.65432739257812,
        198.06491088867188,
        89.1583251953125
      ],
      "text": "Adverse events monitoring",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        92.47692108154297,
        526.6620483398438,
        105.27692413330078
      ],
      "text": "The risk for adverse events during preventive treatment must be minimized. Individuals receiving treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.47692108154297,
        526.6651611328125,
        119.27692413330078
      ],
      "text": "for LTBI should be monitored routinely and regularly at monthly visits to health care providers. The prescribing",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.47692108154297,
        526.68408203125,
        133.27691650390625
      ],
      "text": "health care provider should explain the disease process and the rationale for the treatment and emphasize the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        134.4769287109375,
        526.6171875,
        147.27691650390625
      ],
      "text": "importance of completing it. People receiving treatment should be urged to contact their health care providers",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        148.4769287109375,
        526.6514282226562,
        161.27691650390625
      ],
      "text": "if they develop symptoms between visits, such as anorexia, nausea, vomiting, abdominal discomfort, persistent",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        162.4769287109375,
        526.6622314453125,
        175.27691650390625
      ],
      "text": "fatigue or weakness, dark-coloured urine, pale stools or jaundice. If a health care provider cannot be consulted",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        176.4769287109375,
        401.6680908203125,
        189.27691650390625
      ],
      "text": "at the onset of such symptoms, the patient should immediately stop treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        204.49673461914062,
        310.8336486816406,
        220.000732421875
      ],
      "text": "Adherence and completion of preventive treatment",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.31939697265625,
        526.691162109375,
        236.119384765625
      ],
      "text": "Adherence to the full course and completion of treatment are important determinants of clinical benefit, both",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        237.31939697265625,
        526.709228515625,
        250.119384765625
      ],
      "text": "to the individual and to the success of the programme. Interventions should be tailored to the specific needs of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.31939697265625,
        443.4291687011719,
        264.119384765625
      ],
      "text": "the risk groups and to the local context to ensure adherence and completion of treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.3393249511719,
        330.9037170410156,
        294.84332275390625
      ],
      "text": "Programmatic management, monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.16192626953125,
        526.682373046875,
        310.9619140625
      ],
      "text": "The national programme should prepare a national plan for programmatic management of LTBI, including",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        312.16192626953125,
        526.680419921875,
        324.9619140625
      ],
      "text": "prioritizing groups identified as being at high risk on the basis of local epidemiology and the health system.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.16192626953125,
        526.6314086914062,
        338.9619140625
      ],
      "text": "They should create a conducive environment for the policy and the programme, including national and local",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        340.16192626953125,
        526.6731567382812,
        352.9619140625
      ],
      "text": "policies and standard operating procedures to facilitate implementation of the recommendations in these",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.16192626953125,
        526.6923217773438,
        366.9619140625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines. Programmatic management of LTBI should include monitoring and evaluation systems that are",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        368.16192626953125,
        526.6401977539062,
        380.9619140625
      ],
      "text": "aligned with national systems for patient monitoring and surveillance. Appropriate recording and reporting",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.16192626953125,
        306.6510925292969,
        394.9619140625
      ],
      "text": "tools should be developed, with standardized indicators.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        47.15700149536133,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.69300079345703,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "4",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.524658203125,
        458.3740539550781,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION: UPDATED AND CONSOLIDATED GUIDELINES FOR PROGRAMMATIC MANAGEMENT",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}